WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:05.567
-Give it up for the fantastic
8G Band right over there.

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:06.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.801 --> 00:00:08.834
And we're also so happy to have

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:11.567
our friend Fred Armisen
here with us this week.

00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:13.567
Give it up for Fred,
everybody.

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:16.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:20.868
It was Fred's birthday
this weekend, and we were all on

00:00:20.868 --> 00:00:24.133
a text chain with Maya and Amy,
our friends.

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:26.167
That was so nice.
Maya Rudolph, Amy Poehler.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:29.100
-So nice, so nice.
I miss them.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.467
-I miss them, too.

00:00:30.467 --> 00:00:32.000
-You know, it's a bummer.
They wanted to come on

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.067
to promote the new season
of "Baking It,"

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:37.868
but they could only be guests
via Zoom so it didn't work out.

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:39.434
-You didn't want
to have them on Zoom?

00:00:39.434 --> 00:00:42.667
-No, I just feel like once
you have some guess

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:44.467
via Zoom,
everyone wants to do it.

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:46.067
You know, so it's just like a
slippery slope.

00:00:46.067 --> 00:00:47.400
-Okay, I can see that then.
That makes total sense.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.868
-Yeah, I love baking.

00:00:48.868 --> 00:00:50.567
Thanks for supporting me
on that.

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:51.567
Oh.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:53.000
-It doesn't make sense.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.968
-What's wrong with you?

00:00:55.968 --> 00:00:57.467
-What are you guys doing?

00:00:57.467 --> 00:00:59.734
-Hi.
-Hi.

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:01.734
But what are you doing here?

00:01:01.734 --> 00:01:04.267
-Well, we're doing this
interview via Zoom

00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:06.133
the way we told you
we were going to do it.

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:08.968
-Yeah, but -- but I said no.

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:12.334
-Yeah, it's not up to you, Seth.

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:13.767
It's up to the audience.

00:01:13.767 --> 00:01:15.701
-Oh, come on.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:19.133
-You guys want us
to do it via Zoom?

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:21.300
Yeah, that's what I thought.
That's what I thought.

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:24.567
-Guys, it's great to see you,
but it's just less fun via Zoom.

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:27.534
-Seth, you're less fun via Zoom.

00:01:27.534 --> 00:01:29.434
Maya and I are fun
no matter what.

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:32.200
-Plus, Zoom is great
for interviews

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:34.801
because you can pretend
the connection is bad...

00:01:34.801 --> 00:01:35.801
-Yeah.
-...when you get asked

00:01:35.801 --> 00:01:36.801
a tough question.

00:01:36.801 --> 00:01:38.234
Go ahead, ask us a tough
question.

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:39.934
Just ask me anything.

00:01:39.934 --> 00:01:41.934
-Yeah, we know you usually do
softballs, but I don't know.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:44.000
Try us a tough question
for once.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.534
-Yes, ask us a tough one.

00:01:45.534 --> 00:01:47.701
-Yeah, do like
a Jake Tapper tough one.

00:01:47.701 --> 00:01:50.000
-Alright, fine, fine.
You want a tough question?

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.567
Who do you guys think
should take over

00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:54.467
"SNL" after Lorne leaves?

00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:56.934
-That's a great ques--

00:01:56.934 --> 00:01:58.767
I think...

00:01:58.767 --> 00:02:00.801
if...

00:02:00.801 --> 00:02:02.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:06.033
five...

00:02:06.033 --> 00:02:07.467
forever.

00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:10.367
-See?
See how fun that was?

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:13.133
-Was it a baby, Amy?
Were you saying a baby?

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:16.133
-A baby's gonna take over
after Lorne.

00:02:16.133 --> 00:02:18.033
-I'm just worried.
I love to see you guys again.

00:02:18.033 --> 00:02:20.267
I'm just worried that I say it's
okay to have one guest on Zoom

00:02:20.267 --> 00:02:22.567
then everyone's going to want
to be on Zoom.

00:02:22.567 --> 00:02:23.934
-No.
-Okay.

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:27.834
Would you have Clooney
and Roberts via Zoom?

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:31.868
-Yeah.
George and Julia?

00:02:31.868 --> 00:02:35.300
-Yeah, if they wanted to come on
Zoom, would you say yes?

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:38.567
-Would you?
-I mean, I guess so.

00:02:38.567 --> 00:02:40.734
-Yeah, well, good news, dude,

00:02:40.734 --> 00:02:43.367
because we're the new Clooney
and Roberts.

00:02:43.367 --> 00:02:44.734
-Pretty woman right here.

00:02:44.734 --> 00:02:46.234
-Danny Ocean right here.

00:02:46.234 --> 00:02:47.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:47.701 --> 00:02:51.133
-Wait, Amy, why are you
Danny Ocean?

00:02:51.133 --> 00:02:52.901
-Oh, I'm Danny Ocean.
-Yeah.

00:02:52.901 --> 00:02:54.934
-Oh, yeah, I'm Danny Ocean.
You know why?

00:02:54.934 --> 00:02:56.868
-Why
-Seth, where's your wallet?

00:02:56.868 --> 00:02:58.400
-Check my wallet?

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.400
-Yeah.
-It's in my pocket.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:00.467
Wait.
-Is it?

00:03:00.467 --> 00:03:02.801
-Oh, God. Oh no.
-Is it?

00:03:02.801 --> 00:03:04.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.901 --> 00:03:06.434
Zoom is fun, dude.
-Right?

00:03:06.434 --> 00:03:10.934
-I -- yeah, I still think it
would be more fun in person.

00:03:10.934 --> 00:03:15.167
-Well, I'm sorry I couldn't be
there in person.

00:03:15.167 --> 00:03:17.667
-Oh no, you really stepped in it
now, Seth.

00:03:17.667 --> 00:03:21.167
-What?
-You know what? Alright?

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:26.100
Our beloved pet dog, Angus...

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.734
just went in for surgery.
-Okay.

00:03:27.734 --> 00:03:31.200
-Not that you want to know
that because you didn't ask.

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.000
-It's not his fault, Maya.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.801
He can't help
that he's a bad person.

00:03:34.801 --> 00:03:37.367
-You know what?
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.367 --> 00:03:40.133
I'm really sorry to hear about
your dog, Maya.

00:03:40.133 --> 00:03:41.667
What kind of surgery was it?

00:03:41.667 --> 00:03:43.133
-Thank you.

00:03:43.133 --> 00:03:46.100
Um, he's getting his
[bleep] enlarged.

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:49.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:57.067
-See, Zoom is fun.

00:03:57.067 --> 00:04:00.334
-We don't have a dog, you dope.
-You feel for it.

00:04:00.334 --> 00:04:03.767
-You guys, I'm sorry, I have a
show to do, alright?

00:04:03.767 --> 00:04:05.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:09.067
Fred -- Fred, you're here.

00:04:09.067 --> 00:04:12.400
Why would you join -- why would
you join via Zoom?

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:13.567
You're here.

00:04:13.567 --> 00:04:15.901
-It just seemed
like a lot of fun.

00:04:15.901 --> 00:04:18.267
-Yeah, Fred gets it.
-See, he's not stupid.

00:04:18.267 --> 00:04:19.767
-Fred likes to have fun.
-Yeah, he's not a jerk.

00:04:19.767 --> 00:04:24.434
-Fred, you just agreed with me
that it is better in person.

00:04:24.434 --> 00:04:25.667
-Fred.
-Wow.

00:04:25.667 --> 00:04:27.634
-Fred.
Is that true, Fred?

00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:29.634
-Wow.
-Wow, Fred.

00:04:29.634 --> 00:04:30.901
-Wow.
-Wow.

00:04:30.901 --> 00:04:32.534
-Fred, don't lie to us.

00:04:32.534 --> 00:04:36.701
-Yeah, Fred,
why would you lie to us?

00:04:36.701 --> 00:04:37.868
Fred?

00:04:39.534 --> 00:04:41.400
-[ Indistinct ]

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:45.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:45.901 --> 00:04:48.000
[ Indistinct talking ]

00:04:51.133 --> 00:04:54.033
[ Laughter ]

00:04:54.033 --> 00:04:55.834
-Alright, I gotta go.

00:04:55.834 --> 00:04:57.667
Do you guys have any --
do you have anything

00:04:57.667 --> 00:04:59.501
you want to tell us about,
Amy and Maya?

00:04:59.501 --> 00:05:00.968
-Yeah.
-Yeah, "Baking It."

00:05:00.968 --> 00:05:03.434
We're plugging "Baking It."
We hosted that together.

00:05:03.434 --> 00:05:05.701
Watch that, you guys.
-It's great.

00:05:05.701 --> 00:05:07.901
Watch it.
-Yeah. Please do.

00:05:07.901 --> 00:05:09.234
And it's great
to see you both --

00:05:09.234 --> 00:05:11.834
-"Baking It."
It's on Peacock.

00:05:11.834 --> 00:05:13.567
Those are two of the best
people in the world.

00:05:13.567 --> 00:05:16.334
Maya Rudolph and Amy Poehler
via Zoom, it doesn't matter.

00:05:16.334 --> 00:05:18.033
-We love you very much.

00:05:18.033 --> 00:05:20.634
-They're the best in the biz.

00:05:20.634 --> 00:05:21.901
You can watch them on Peacock.

00:05:21.901 --> 00:05:23.501
We'll be right back
with Chris Hayes.

